      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-product-line/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;OPT&amp;rsquo;s 3D camera portfolio is organized around the major industrial sensing routes: laser profile cameras for scanning and micrometer-level measurement, projected structured-light cameras for one-shot high-precision reconstruction, speckle/RGB-D cameras for large field-of-view depth and color capture, and ToF cameras for high-frame-rate perception.&lt;/p&gt;
