&lt;h2 id=&#34;my-role&#34;&gt;My role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My role is centered on the algorithm and software layer that turns 3D camera data into deployable inspection workflows: reconstruction, calibration, point-cloud/mesh processing, measurement, defect detection, registration, robot guidance, and Smart3 integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;product-architecture&#34;&gt;Product architecture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The product line is designed as a hardware and software suite rather than a set of isolated sensors. Camera families cover close-range high-precision measurement, large-format depth acquisition, 2D/3D aligned inspection, and robot guidance. The Smart3 algorithm platform connects the camera output to visual workflow design, point-cloud processing, measurement tools, and production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















