&lt;em&gt;The portfolio compares laser triangulation, temporal coded structured light, and binocular speckle depth sensing.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;technology-routes&#34;&gt;Technology routes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Laser profile cameras emphasize mature motion-assisted measurement with um-level precision. Projected structured light emphasizes one-shot reconstruction and high repeatability for static or indexed parts. Speckle/RGB-D cameras emphasize wide field-of-view capture, RGB-depth alignment, and cost-effective logistics or robot-vision use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
