&lt;em&gt;Different routes are positioned by speed, precision, and application scenarios.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;system-deployment&#34;&gt;System deployment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The camera line is paired with the Smart3 visual algorithm platform, allowing inspection workflows to be configured with camera acquisition, preprocessing, point-cloud reconstruction, measurement, defect detection, and user-defined visualization.&lt;/p&gt;
