&lt;h2 id=&#34;industry-coverage&#34;&gt;Industry coverage&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The product line is positioned for lithium batteries, 3C electronics, photovoltaic, semiconductor, automotive, robotics, food, medicine, chemical, and warehouse automation scenarios, with applications including glue inspection, PCB measurement, welding inspection, dimensional checking, robot guidance, and volume measurement.&lt;/p&gt;
